    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Spicy Carrots</strong> <em>(Cooking Rank 2)</em></p><p>When you take the Dodge action on your turn, until the start of your next turn, any damage you take is reduced by an amount equal to your Dexterity modifier.</p><p><em>Artisan Cooking Rank 2 meal boon (DC 13). Apply after eating a successful meal. Duration is typically until your next meal or 24 hours (DM&apos;s call), unless noted otherwise.</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Spicy Carrots</strong></p><p>Dodge: reduce damage by Dexterity modifier.</p>"
